  "details": "1. Go to https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_7ec7bbdd-ba81-4564-985a-c79dfc9eaca7 with at least two accounts/players\n\n2. have the player who is listening configure the menu as shown in the images\n\n3. have the speaking player position themselves as shown and speak\n\n4. listen for voice activity\n\nIf followed correctly:\n\nIn case of the example of being out of range it is currently possible to hear the player (shouldn't be happening I assume).\n\nThe opposite happens in case of being inside range: I can't hear the other player at all even though based on the set range values I expect it and the icon also shows voice activity.\n\nThe shown world uses\n\nSetVoiceDistanceFar (green sphere)\n\nSetVoiceDistanceNear (red sphere)\n\nSetVoiceVolumetricRadius (light blue sphere)",
